lt with the spectral approach, and analyze possible equality or degeneracy in the stability estimate. Do not carry out those later rounds now.\\n\\nReport requirements: Produce one concise complete report, preferably below 1200 words, including assumptions, explicit algebraic derivations, equality and sharpness arguments, edge-case verification, obstacles if any, and specific next steps for Round 2. Clearly separate proof from conjecture. Do not use external data or execute software. Do not claim independent verification. Stop after this one round."
